requestCommandAdmission (:886-929):
- writes the request through writeNew with a 16-byte nonce (:888, :898) and records the request digest (:899);
- prints a stdout notice (:900);
- watches the exact response basename with fs.watch (:919-921) under one setTimeout bounded by min(group deadline, now+30000) (:889, :923);
